 "about": {
  "heading": "About",
  "paragraph": "I’m Ramy, a Video generalist and former Team Lead with experience across reels, documentaries, news reports, and large-scale event coverage, including the World Government Summit, Davos, One Billion Summit, The Economist, World’s Coolest Winter, and Emirates Love. I’ve worked with clients such as Hala Kazim, Anas Bukhash, McDonald’s, Elsewedy Electric, Al Maryah Island, and Blue Cherry. I studied Computer Science at SCU, then developed my creative career through a Graphic Design specialization at CalArts, advanced animation training at The School of Motion, and Cinematic Videography at SAE Dubai. I’m also a Golden Visa holder under Dubai Culture & Arts Authority.",
